    "detailed_description": "Tower Collapse is an arcade puzzle game, and the first game released by solo indie dev Significant Otter Games. The camera spins while you play, spinning around the central tower. Remove or push blocks to score points. The more turns are taken, the more unstable the tower becomes and the faster the camera spins, making it harder to remove the blocks you want!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163210/extras/76205cf5e9d95d5b3adc6cc6bbb33890.poster.avif?t=1743419868\" width=600 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163210/extras/76205cf5e9d95d5b3adc6cc6bbb33890.webm?t=1743419868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163210/extras/76205cf5e9d95d5b3adc6cc6bbb33890.mp4?t=1743419868\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Singleplayer and local multiplayer mode (2 player)</li><li>Two game modes - classic mode and block push mode</li><li>5 levels to choose from: House, Beach, Monument, Museum and City</li><li>5 bonus tower layouts</li><li>Reduced movement option, say goodbye to motion sickness</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163210/extras/14ab43477dd1c6ce34b6b1f524d69169.poster.avif?t=1743419868\" width=600 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163210/extras/14ab43477dd1c6ce34b6b1f524d69169.webm?t=1743419868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163210/extras/14ab43477dd1c6ce34b6b1f524d69169.mp4?t=1743419868\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
